Source: libflagcx-@BACKEND@
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: FlagOS Contributors <flagos@baai.ac.cn>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), patchelf
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/flagos-ai/FlagCX
X-FlagCX-Backend: @BACKEND@
X-FlagCX-Build-Image: @BUILD_IMAGE@
X-FlagCX-Build-Infra-Version: @BUILD_INFRA_VERSION@

Package: libflagcx-@BACKEND@
Section: libs
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= @GLIBC_FLOOR@)
@PROVIDES@
@CONFLICTS@
@REPLACES@
Description: FlagCX collective communications library for @BACKEND@
 FlagCX is a unified collective communication library: one API, one set of
 collectives, with a per-vendor adaptor underneath.
 .
 This package is the @VENDOR@ adaptor built against the SDK shipped in the
 FlagOS @BACKEND@ base image. The vendor libraries it links (@VENDOR_LIBS@)
 are supplied by the site's driver and SDK installation, so they are
 deliberately not dependencies of this package.

Package: libflagcx-@BACKEND@-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libflagcx-@BACKEND@ (= ${binary:Version})
@CONFLICTS_DEV@
@REPLACES_DEV@
Description: FlagCX development files for @BACKEND@
 Public headers and the unversioned linker name for the FlagCX collective
 communications library, @VENDOR@ backend.
